WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.012
Vinnie and Mandy sat talking in the living room.

2
00:00:04.013 --> 00:00:08.664
The children were nervous about Dad’s idea for his den.

3
00:00:08.665 --> 00:00:14.840
"We have to go on as many photo trips as possible," said Mandy urgently.

4
00:00:14.841 --> 00:00:20.507
"After the attic becomes Dad’s den, we won’t be able to go anymore."

5
00:00:20.508 --> 00:00:23.924
"I know," Vinnie said.

6
00:00:23.925 --> 00:00:27.899
"But now Dad is always in the attic.

7
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:31.668
If only he would leave for a while . . ."

8
00:00:31.669 --> 00:00:35.427
Loud barking interrupted the children.

9
00:00:35.428 --> 00:00:40.991
"Look who’s visiting," said Mom, walking through the front door.

10
00:00:40.992 --> 00:00:44.370
A black dog rushed in after her.

11
00:00:44.371 --> 00:00:48.921
"Corky!" cried Vinnie, rubbing the dog’s head.

12
00:00:48.922 --> 00:00:53.123
Corky was the neighbor’s dog and very friendly.

13
00:00:53.124 --> 00:00:58.997
"I thought I heard Corky’s bark!" said Dad, coming down the stairs.

14
00:00:58.998 --> 00:01:02.014
Corky jumped into his arms.

15
00:01:02.015 --> 00:01:04.775
"Good boy! Good Corky!"

16
00:01:04.776 --> 00:01:08.245
Dad patted the dog affectionately.

17
00:01:08.246 --> 00:01:13.445
"We’ve been asked to watch Corky for a few hours," said Mom.

18
00:01:13.446 --> 00:01:17.021
"Our neighbor has a doctor’s appointment."

19
00:01:17.022 --> 00:01:23.914
Dad loved dogs and wanted to get one, but Mom always said no.

20
00:01:23.915 --> 00:01:27.992
"I have an idea," Dad said brightly.

21
00:01:27.993 --> 00:01:31.495
"Let’s take Corky to the park."

22
00:01:31.496 --> 00:01:34.658
"Sounds good," agreed Vinnie.

23
00:01:34.659 --> 00:01:37.236
"I can take my bike."

24
00:01:37.237 --> 00:01:40.906
Mandy stared hard at her brother.

25
00:01:40.907 --> 00:01:45.804
"Vinnie!" she said through clenched teeth.

26
00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:50.618
"Mandy? Do you want to go too?" asked Mom.

27
00:01:50.619 --> 00:01:55.398
"Uh, yes," Mandy said slowly.

28
00:01:55.399 --> 00:01:59.242
"But I have to get something from upstairs.

29
00:01:59.243 --> 00:02:01.312
Vinnie does too."

30
00:02:01.313 --> 00:02:05.008
"I do?" Vinnie looked puzzled.

31
00:02:05.009 --> 00:02:08.477
Then he realized what Mandy meant.

32
00:02:08.478 --> 00:02:10.674
"That’s right!

33
00:02:10.675 --> 00:02:13.111
We’ll be right back."

34
00:02:13.112 --> 00:02:17.520
Vinnie followed Mandy up to the attic.

35
00:02:17.521 --> 00:02:22.169
"Sorry about that," he said, reaching for the album.

36
00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:25.388
"I didn’t catch on to your plan."

37
00:02:25.389 --> 00:02:29.756
"We can go on a photo trip," said Mandy.

38
00:02:29.757 --> 00:02:33.558
"And still be back in time to play with Corky."

39
00:02:33.559 --> 00:02:37.603
Vinnie opened the album to the next page.

40
00:02:37.604 --> 00:02:41.629
"Look at this one, Mandy," he said.

41
00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:45.992
The old man was on a ship at sea.

42
00:02:45.993 --> 00:02:49.887
He stood near a large coil of rope.

43
00:02:49.888 --> 00:02:55.220
Three small round things rested on top of the coil.

44
00:02:55.221 --> 00:03:01.054
"They look like rocks," said Mandy, examining the picture.

45
00:03:01.055 --> 00:03:04.989
Next to them, a wooden object glowed.

46
00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:07.740
"What could this be?"

47
00:03:07.741 --> 00:03:11.553
"We’ll soon find out!" said Vinnie.

48
00:03:11.554 --> 00:03:19.787
The children’s eyes closed, and they fell down the dark tunnel.

49
00:03:19.788 --> 00:03:25.415
The children landed hard, and their fall echoed loudly.

50
00:03:25.416 --> 00:03:30.763
They were in a building with a high ceiling and large windows.

51
00:03:30.764 --> 00:03:35.212
The children lay between some wooden benches.

52
00:03:35.213 --> 00:03:39.742
"I think we’re in a church," whispered Vinnie.

53
00:03:39.743 --> 00:03:43.300
He pointed to a large cross on the wall.

54
00:03:43.301 --> 00:03:46.281
There were statues of angels too.

55
00:03:46.282 --> 00:03:50.124
"Look," said Mandy quietly.

56
00:03:50.125 --> 00:03:54.570
She pointed at two men standing together and talking.

57
00:03:54.571 --> 00:03:58.522
One man held a book close to his chest.

58
00:03:58.523 --> 00:04:01.546
"Finally!" the man said.

59
00:04:01.547 --> 00:04:05.539
"The king and queen have provided the money for my journey.

60
00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:11.133
With your powerful family behind me, we’ll sail west to the Indies."

61
00:04:11.134 --> 00:04:16.885
"My brothers and I support you fully, Master Columbus," said the other man.

62
00:04:16.886 --> 00:04:20.139
"Columbus?" whispered Vinnie.

63
00:04:20.140 --> 00:04:30.114
"Is he Christopher Columbus?"

